{"title":"Artificial Christmas Trees from $500 - $1000","description":"\u003cp\u003eExplore Our $500-$1000 Artificial Christmas Tree Collection\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eStep into luxury with our curated selection of artificial Christmas trees priced between $500 and $1000. At King of Christmas, we offer an exclusive range of high-quality trees that bring a touch of elegance and grandeur to your festive décor. Whether you’re looking for a statement piece that captures the essence of the season or a sophisticated tree to complement your holiday design, this collection is designed for those who seek the very best.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003ePremium Styles for a Stunning Holiday Display\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eOur $500-$1000 collection features trees that are crafted with meticulous attention to detail, offering the finest in holiday décor. From the rich, realistic greens of traditional styles to the frosty allure of flocked trees, each tree in this collection is built to impress. These trees are not just decorations; they are the focal point of your holiday celebrations, embodying the spirit of the season with elegance and charm.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eHassle-Free Setup and Long-Term Storage\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eInvesting in a premium tree should come with the convenience of easy setup and storage. Our trees are engineered with hinged branches for quick assembly, allowing you to spend more time enjoying the holiday season. After the festivities, store your tree securely with our durable storage solutions, ensuring it remains pristine year after year.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eCreate a Lasting Holiday Tradition\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003eLet our premium artificial Christmas trees be the centerpiece of your most memorable holiday moments. Designed to last, these trees will be a part of your family’s celebrations for many years. Explore the collection and find the perfect tree that will elevate your holiday décor to new heights.\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003c!----\u003e","products":[{"product_id":"10-foot-prince-flock-tree-led","title":"10' Prince Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 750 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the serene beauty of a snow-dusted forest into your home with the Prince Flock. Designed to reflect the natural charm of a Subalpine Fir from the Rocky Mountains, its frosted needles and realistic shape evoke the tranquility of a winter landscape. Perfectly detailed, it becomes a stunning centerpiece for your holiday celebrations.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"10' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642896707648,"sku":"PF-T10-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/PrinceFlock_5024a958-646c-4413-8cbb-72107e8ba72d_1.jpg?v=1761241980"},{"product_id":"7-5-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"7.5' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 800 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"7.5' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642897657920,"sku":"QF-T7.5-L","price":599.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_27cc53c6-965e-42b2-aec7-3712ea7dcff9.jpg?v=1722012616"},{"product_id":"9-foot-queen-flock-tree-led","title":"9' Queen Flock® Artificial Christmas Tree with 1100 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eTransform your home into an enchanted frost-kissed forest with the beautifully sculpted Queen Flock. Inspired by the majestic Alpine Fir of Washington’s wilderness, its snow-dusted branches and authentic silhouette create a cozy, wintry centerpiece. Perfectly detailed, it sets the stage for holiday traditions and cherished seasonal moments.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Full \/ LED","offer_id":28642898804800,"sku":"QF-T9-L","price":999.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/QueenFlock_570c2957-702c-4393-95f3-99e0455c528e.jpg?v=1722012619"},{"product_id":"9-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-led","title":"9' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree with 900 Warm White LED Lights","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"9' \/ Slim \/ LED","offer_id":28642902212672,"sku":"KFS-T9-L","price":799.0,"currency_code":"USD","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0130\/8226\/3616\/files\/KingFlockSlim_75ca9054-4438-4cb7-8f01-f0b3c6b36b67.jpg?v=1714673452"},{"product_id":"12-foot-king-flock-slim-tree-unlit","title":"12' King Flock® Slim Artificial Christmas Tree Unlit","description":"\u003cp\u003eBring the magic of a snowy morning into your home with the enchanting King Flock. Handcrafted to mimic the Subalpine Fir, native to the snow-draped Rocky Mountains. Its realistic “fresh snow” tips capture the charm of a blissful snowy retreat without ever stepping outside. Enjoy its beauty and experience why flocked Christmas trees have become a beloved holiday tradition.\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"King of Christmas","offers":[{"title":"12' \/ Slim \/ Unlit","offer_id":28642902704192